infographic sequence-ascending-steps
data
  title Scope: five levels
  desc Read bottom-up. Amber = scope. Start with scenarios; add a level when its trigger fires.
  sequences
    - label Scenarios
      desc Twenty stories, permanent IDs, functional done. Trigger: works but wrong.
      icon clipboard check
    - label Decisions
      desc exploring to firm, with expiry. Trigger: choices get relitigated.
      icon gavel
    - label Thin PRD
      desc Why, who, cuts. Trigger: why debates recur.
      icon file text
    - label Intents
      desc One file per release: in, out, why. Trigger: cuts get re-argued.
      icon door open
    - label Design + content
      desc Pinned baseline plus deltas, keyed copy. Trigger: designer bottleneck.
      icon palette
  order asc
theme
  palette #B27A24 #B27A24 #B27A24 #B27A24 #B27A24
